# CLM Onboarding Checklist

Used to onboard new users (legal and business teams) onto a contract
lifecycle management system — built while rolling out Ironclad and
DocuSign company-wide and onboarding 30–35 employees.

## Before Access is Granted
- [ ] Confirm role: Requestor / Reviewer / Approver / Signatory
- [ ] Assign permission level (view-only, edit, approval authority)
- [ ] Verify department and contract-type mapping

## Training Session
- [ ] Walk through intake form and required fields
- [ ] Explain approval routing (standard vs. escalated risk)
- [ ] Demo template selection and auto-population
- [ ] Show status tracking and notification settings
- [ ] Review DocuSign signing flow and envelope tracking

## Post-Training
- [ ] User submits one test request
- [ ] Confirm routing worked as expected
- [ ] Add user to relevant Jira intake queue
- [ ] Share quick-reference guide (1-pager)

## Common Issues to Flag Early
- Wrong template selected for contract type
- Missing required approver in routing chain
- Signature fields misaligned in DocuSign envelope

---
*Generalized from a real onboarding process; used to standardize CLM
adoption across legal and business teams.*
